{"author":"Joe Oakhart","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"fields":{"description":"## Context / Problem\n13 MB of research artefacts (65 .py, 39 md, 36 jsonl, 30 json, 17 yaml; `plan-review-gate/runs` alone 10 MB) live under `docs/experiments/`, and `docs/calibration/` holds 4 notes plus `plan_v5_rescore.py`, so docs tooling link-checks them and CodeQL excludes them by name. 12 tests load harness files by path (`tests/unit/test_criterion_effectiveness.py:19`, `test_e6_agreement.py:16`, `test_gate_eval_classifier.py:17`, `test_derive_code_review_threshold.py:12`, `test_impact_model_versioning.py:46,168`, `test_ac_process_gate_criterion.py:118`, `test_asserted_capability_criterion.py:115`, `test_decomp_shape_criterion.py:183`, `test_necessity_criterion.py:103`, `test_project_failure_disposition_contract.py:242`, `test_t15_overlay_derisk_criterion.py:156`); five assert the string (`test_transition_force_flag_24f7.py:163-170`, `tests/interfaces/contracts/test_bridge_vocabulary_stale_heldout.py:25`, `tests/unit/test_check_criteria_vocabulary.py:168,212`, `tests/unit/test_check_dco_identity.py:6,110`, `tests/scripts/test_classify_gerrit_verify_change.py:57-58`); three scripts or configs encode the prefix (`scripts/check_criteria_vocabulary.py:50`, `scripts/check_dco_identity.py:30`, `.github/codeql/codeql-config.yml:4,7`); `.gitignore:20,124-127` ignores the replay cache by path; `src/rebar/llm/reviewers/plan_review_A1.md:10` keys a reviewer rule on \"a path under docs/experiments/\". Packaging is confirmed non-shipping: hatchling wheel `packages = [\"src/rebar\"]` (`pyproject.toml:363-367`), sdist `include = [\"src/rebar\", \"tests\", \"README.md\"]` (`:397-398`), no `MANIFEST.in`. `scripts/check_docs_index.py` indexes only `docs/*.md` (`:70-88`) and link-checks `docs` recursively via `MARKDOWN_SOURCE_TREES` (`:103`), so after the move it simply stops seeing the tree. Cites are on origin/main 360d504f5ceb.\n\n## Approach\n`git mv docs/experiments evals && git mv docs/calibration evals/calibration` (history preserved). Flip `rebar.toml` `[llm.evals] corpus_root = \"evals\"`. Repoint the 12 file-loading tests and 5 string tests, the two scripts, CodeQL (`paths-ignore: evals/**`), `.gitignore` (`evals/plan-review-gate/runs/criterion_firings.jsonl`, `evals/plan-review-gate/replay/cache/`), `plan_review_A1.md:10` to \"a path under `evals/` (formerly `docs/experiments/`)\", the packaged `src/rebar/llm/code_review/criteria_routing.json` `_comment`s (`:91,111,160,168,176`), the six eval-spec comments (`src/rebar/llm/eval_specs/plan-review-{ac-process-gate:10,asserted-capability:8,decomp-shape:11,finder:5,necessity:7}.eval.yaml`, `README.plan-review.md:67`), and source cites (`src/rebar/grounding/resolve.py:16`, `src/rebar/llm/structured.py:4`, `src/rebar/llm/plan_review/det_advisory.py:196`, `src/rebar/llm/plan_review/det_operator_attested.py:11`, `src/rebar/llm/evals/plan_replay/corpus.py:5`, `legacy_v4_baseline.py:2-6`, `scripts/calibrate_completion_floor.py:9`, `rebar.toml:58`, `tests/unit/gold_set_completion.py:12`, and the six other docstring cites found by the grep in Testing). `evals/calibration/plan_v5_rescore.py` keeps importing `rebar.llm.evals.plan_replay.legacy_v4_baseline` (the import direction is research-to-src, unchanged); `legacy_v4_baseline.py` stays as the importable home of the v4 formula because `evals/` is not on `sys.path`; reword its docstring to the new path. Frozen corpora in `tests/fixtures/*_corpus/*.json` are never rewritten. Ownership: this story edits exactly `docs/README.md:130` and `:142` (link targets `experiments/...` to `../evals/...` and `calibration/...` to `../evals/calibration/...`) because `check_docs_index.py`'s link check fails otherwise; every other line of `docs/README.md` belongs to the docs epic, which depends on this story.\n\n## Scope\n`docs/experiments/**` to `evals/**`; `docs/calibration/**` to `evals/calibration/**`; `rebar.toml`; `.gitignore`; `.github/codeql/codeql-config.yml`; `scripts/check_criteria_vocabulary.py`; `scripts/check_dco_identity.py`; `src/rebar/llm/reviewers/plan_review_A1.md`; `src/rebar/llm/code_review/criteria_routing.json`; `src/rebar/llm/eval_specs/*.eval.yaml` plus `README.plan-review.md`; the source and script cites above; `docs/README.md:130,142`; the 17 tests above. Workflows: `structured-output-baseline.yml` and `prompt-eval.yml` name no `docs/experiments` path (`prompt-eval.yml:147` globs packaged specs), so no edit.\n\n## Testing\nHappy: `pytest tests/unit/test_criterion_effectiveness.py tests/unit/test_e6_agreement.py tests/unit/test_gate_eval_classifier.py tests/unit/test_impact_model_versioning.py tests/unit/test_transition_force_flag_24f7.py tests/unit/test_check_criteria_vocabulary.py tests/unit/test_check_dco_identity.py tests/scripts/test_classify_gerrit_verify_change.py -q`; `python scripts/check_docs_index.py`; `python scripts/check_criteria_vocabulary.py`; `python evals/calibration/plan_v5_rescore.py --root=.`; `git grep -n 'docs/experiments\\|docs/calibration' -- . ':!tests/fixtures' ':!CHANGELOG.md' ':!docs/release-notes.md'` is empty. Edge: `python -m build --wheel && unzip -l dist/*.whl | grep -c 'evals/'` prints `0` and the sdist likewise; `git log --follow evals/plan-review-gate/replay/ledger.jsonl` shows pre-move history.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] `docs/experiments` and `docs/calibration` are absent and `evals/` is present with the identical file count; `git diff --stat -M origin/main` shows only renames plus the edits listed.\n- [ ] The repo-wide grep above prints nothing outside frozen fixtures and historical notes.\n- [ ] The wheel and sdist contain no `evals/` entry.\n- [ ] `git diff -U0 -- docs/README.md` has exactly two hunks (lines 130 and 142).\n- [ ] `make verify` exits 0."}},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"EDIT","timestamp":1788838511803298001,"uuid":"c2309584-3596-49fc-ab31-ebdcfde8bd79"}